pub const INSTRUCTIONS: &str = "codemycel holds a verified knowledge graph of this repository: files, symbols, and the calls, references, imports, and type relations between them, each confirmed by a language server or SCIP index. Counts are lower bounds: anything marked unresolved could not be verified and is listed, never guessed. Start with `search` to find symbols by words, or pass a name you already know directly to `symbol`. Use `impact` before changing a symbol to see what depends on it, `trace` to connect two symbols, `overview` to orient in an unfamiliar area, and `status` when an answer looks stale. Symbol bodies are read from disk on request and flagged if the file changed since indexing. Write durable findings with `note`; later sessions will see them. Each answer ends with a freshness line; trust it.";
